  The metric chips are measurements, not activities, so they do not borrow `ic_glyph_growth`: four chips
  carrying the same picture would say nothing about which one is selected. Stroke line-art at 1.7dp and a
  24dp viewport, the same style and weight as the activity glyphs.
-->
